 407  *==============================================================================
 408  * 2 Declaration of parameters and benchmark variables
 409  *==============================================================================
 410  PARAMETER
 411  *==============================================================================
 412  *  2.1 Parameters
 413  *==============================================================================
 414   A_K(z)               Scale parameter (price of new capital)
 415   aij(i,j,z)           Input output coefficient
 416   aij2(i,j,z)          Input output coefficient (intermediate energy)
 417   B_KD(j,z)            Scale parameter (CES - composite capital)
 418   B_LD(j,z)            Scale parameter (CES - composite labor)
 419   B_M1(i,z)            Scale parameter (CES - composite commodity)
 420   B_M2(i,z)            Scale parameter (CES - composite import)
 421   B_VA(j,z)            Scale parameter (CES - value added)
 422   B_KLE(j,z)           Scale parameter (CES - composite KLE)
 423   B_ENER(j,z)          Scale parameter (CES - composite ENER)
 424   B_X1(i,z)            Scale parameter (CET - total output)
 425   B_X2(i,z)            Scale parameter (CET - composite export)
 426   B_X3(i,z)            Scale parameter (CES - top level)
 427   B_X4(z)              Scale parameter (CES - Aggregated Electricity)
 428   beta_D_X1(i,z)       Share parameter (CET - total output - local sales)
 429   beta_EX_X1(i,z)      Share parameter (CET - total output - export)
 430   beta_X2(i,z,zj)      Share parameter (CET - composite export)
 431   beta_X3(j,i,z)       Share parameter (CES - top level)
 432   beta_X4(power, z)    Share parameter (CES - Aggregated Electricity)
 433   beta_KD(k,j,z)       Share parameter (CES - composite capital)
 434   beta_LD(l,j,z)       Share parameter (CES - composite labor)
 435   beta_M1(i,z)         Share parameter (CES - composite commodity)
 436   beta_M2(i,zj,z)      Share parameter (CES - composite import)
 437   beta_VA(j,z)         Share parameter (CES - value added)
 438   beta_KLE(j,z)        Share parameter (CES - KLE composite)
 439   beta_ENER(ene,j,z)   Share parameter (CES - ENER composite)
 440   delta(z)             Depreciation rate of capital in country z
 441   eta                  Price elasticity of indexed transfers and parameters
 442   frisch(z)            Frisch parameter (LES function)
 443   gamma_GVT(i,z)       Share of commodity i in total current public expenditures on goods and services
 444   gamma_INV(i,z)       Share of commodity i in total investment expenditures
 445   gamma_LES(i,z)       Marginal share of commodity i in household consumption budget
 446   io(j,z)              Coefficient (Leontief - intermediate consumption)
 447   io2(j,z)             Coefficient (Leontief - intermediate energy consumption)
 448   v(j,z)               value added Coefficient (Leontief)
 449   v2(j,z)              KLE Share parameter (Leontief)
 450   kmob                 Flag parameter (1 if capital is mobile)
 451   RES                  Rescaling factor
 452   rho_KD(j,z)          Elasticity paameter (CES - composite capital)
 453   rho_LD(j,z)          Elasticity parameter (CES - composite labor)
 454   rho_M1(i,z)          Elasticity parameter (CES - composite commodity)
 455   rho_M2(i,z)          Elasticity parameter (CES - composite import)
 456   rho_VA(j,z)          Elasticity parameter (CES - value added)
 457   rho_KLE(j,z)         Elasticity parameter (CES - KLE)
 458   rho_ENER(j,z)        Elasticity parameter (CES - ENER)
 459   rho_X1(i,z)          Elasticity parameter (CET - composite export)
 460   rho_X2(i,z)          Elasticity parameter (CET - composite export)
 461   rho_X3(i,z)          Elasticity parameter (CES - top level)
 462   rho_X4(z)            Elasticity parameter (CES - Aggregated Electricity)
 463   sigma_KD(j,z)        Elasticity (CES - composite capital)
 464   sigma_LD(j,z)        Elasticity (CES - composite labor)
 465   sigma_M1(i,z)        Elasticity (CES - composite commodity)
 466   sigma_M2(i,z)        Elasticity (CES - composite import)
 467   sigma_VA(j,z)        Elasticity (CES - value added)
 468   sigma_KLE(j,z)       Elasticity (CES - kle)
 469   sigma_ENER(j,z)      Elasticity (CES - within energy)
 470   sigma_X0(j,z)        Elasticity (CET - exports and local sales)
 471   sigma_X1(i,z)        Elasticity (CET - total output)
 472   sigma_X2(i,z)        Elasticity (CET - composite export)
 473   sigma_X3(i,z)        Elasticity (CES - top level)
 474   sigma_X4(z)          Elasticity (CES - Aggregated Electricity)
 475   sigma_Y(i,z)         Income elasticity of consumption
 476   tmrg(i,ij,zj,z)      Rate of margin i applied to commodity ij imported from country zj
 477   TnDShare(z)          T&D share of Aggregated electricity
 478   PowerShare(z)        Power Industries share of Aggregated electricity
 479   theta2(j,i,z)        Export share of composite activity
 480  * L_EFF(l,j,z)         Efficiency adjusted labor
 481  * LDCO_EFF(j,z)        Composite labor
 482   
 483  *==============================================================================
 484  *  2.2 Variables - Benchmark
 485  *==============================================================================
 486  *  Benchmark values of variables are parameters. Their acronyms are the
 487  *  corresponding variable names,followed by the letter "O".
 488   
 489  *==============================================================================
 490  *   2.2.1 Volume variables
 491  *==============================================================================
 492   CABXO(z)        Current account balance of region z in terms of the international currency (pseudo-volume variable)
 493   CO(i,z)         Consumption of commodity i by households in region z
 494   CGO(i,z)        Public consumption of commodity i in region z
 495   CIO(j,z)        Total intermediate consumption of industry j in region z
 496   CEO(j,z)        Total energy intermediate consumption of industry j in region z
 497   CMINO(i,z)      Minimum consumption of commodity i by households in region z
 498   CTH_REALO(z)    Real household consumption in region z
 499   DDO(i,z)        Domestic demand for commodity i produced locally in region z
 500   DIO(i,j,z)      Intermediate consumption of commodity i by industry j in region z
 501   DEO(ene,j,z)    Intermediate energy consumption of commodity i by industry j in region z
 502   DITO(i,z)       Total intermediate demand of commodity i in region z
 503   DSO(j,i,z)      Supply of commodity i by sector j to the domestic market
 504   DSO_I(i,z)      Supply of commodity i to the domestic market of region z
 505   DSO_J(j,z)      Supply of activity j to the domestic market of region z
 506   EXO(i,z,zj)     Quantity of product i exported by country z to country zj
 507   EXTO(i,z)       Supply of composite commodity i by region z to the export market
 508   EXTTO(j,i,z)    Supply of activity j to the export market i of region z
 509   G_REALO(z)      Current real government expenditures on goods and services in region z
 510   GDP_BP_REALO(z) Real GDP at basic prices
 511   GDP_MP_REALO(z) Real GDP at market prices
 512   GDP_BP_W_REALO  Real GDP at basic prices
 513   IMO(i,zj,z)     Quantity of product i imported by country z from country zj
 514   IMO2(zj,z)      Quantity of product i imported by country z from country zj
 515   IMTO(i,z)       Quantity demanded of composite imports of commodity i by region z
 516   INVO(i,z)       Final demand of commodity i for investment purposes (GFCF) in region z
 517   IT_REALO(z)     Real gross fixed capital formation
 518   KDO(k,j,z)      Demand for type k capital by industry j in region z
 519   KDCO(j,z)       Demand for composite capital by industry j in region z
 520   KSO(k,z)        Supply of type k capital in region z
 521   KSTO(z)         Total supply of capital in region z
 522   LDO(l,j,z)      Demand for type l labor by industry j in region z
 523   LDCO(j,z)       Demand for composite labor by industry j in region z
 524   LSO(l,z)        Supply of type l labor in region z
 525   MRGNO(i,z)      Domestic production of commodity i in region z exported as international margin services
 526   POPO(z)         Population in 2019
 527   QO(i,z)         Quantity demanded of composite commodity i in region z
 528   VAO(j,z)        Value added of industry j in region z
 529   KLEO(j,z)       KLE of industry j in region z
 530   XSO_I(i,z)      Commoidty i total production
 531   XSO(j,i,z)      Total output of industry j in region z
 532   XSTO(j,z)       Total output of industry j
 533   POWERQO(z)      Total power output in region z
 534   
 535  *==============================================================================
 536  *   2.2.2 Price variables
 537  *==============================================================================
 538   eO(z)           Exchange rate (price of international currency in terms of region z local currency)
 539   PO(i,z)         Basic price of commodity i in region z
 540   PO2(j,i,z)      Basic price of industry j production of commodity i
 541   PO3(i,j,z)
 542   PO4(i,j,z)
 543   PPOWERO(z)
 544   PIO(i,z)        Basic price of commodity is output
 545   PTO(j,z)        Basic price of industry js output
 546   PCO(i,z)        Purchaser price of composite commodity i (including all taxes and margins) in region z
 547   PCIO(j,z)       Intermediate consumption price index of industry j in region z
 548   PCEO(j,z)       Intermediate energy consumption price index of industry j in region z
 549   PDO(i,z)        Price of local product i sold on region z domestic market (including all taxes)
 550   PEO(i,z,zj)     Price received for commodity i exported to region zj by region z (excluding export taxes)
 551   PETO(i,z)       Border price of composite commodity i exported by region z
 552   PIXCONO(z)      Consumer price index in region z
 553   PIXGDPO(z)      GDP deflator in region z
 554   PIXGDP_WO       World GDP deflator
 555   PIXGVTO(z)      Public expenditures price index in region z
 556   PIXINVO(z)      Investment price index in region z
 557   PKO(z)          Price of new capital in region z
 558   PLO(i,z)        Price of local product i (excluding all taxes on products) in region z
 559   PMO(i,zj,z)     Price of commodity i imported by region z from region zj (including all taxes duties and margins)
 560   PMTO(i,z)       Price of composite commodity i imported by region z (including all taxes duties and margins)
 561   PPO(j,z)        Unit cost of industry j in region z including taxes directly related to the use of capital and labor but excluding other taxes on production
 562   PVAO(j,Z)       Price of industry j value added in region z (including taxes on production directly related to the use of capital and labor)
 563   PKLEO(j,z)      Price of industry j KLE in region z
 564   PWMO(i,zj,z)    World price of commodity i imported from country zj by region z (expressed in international currency)
 565   PWMGO(i)        World price of margin i (expressed in international currency)
 566   PWXO(i,z,zj)    World price of commodity i exported to country zj by region z (expressed in international currency)
 567   RO(k,j,z)       Rental rate of type k capital in industry j of region z
 568   RCO(j,z)        Rental rate of industry j composite capital in region z
 569   RKO(k,z)        Rental rate of type k capital in region z
 570   RTIO(k,j,z)     Rental rate paid by industry j for type k capital in region z including capital taxes
 571   WO(l,z)         Wage rate of type l labor in region z
 572   WCO(j,z)        Wage rate of industry j composite labor in region z
 573   WTIO(l,j,z)     Wage rate paid z by industry j for type l labor in region including payroll taxes
 574   
 575   
 576  *==============================================================================
 577  *   2.2.3 Nominal (value) variables
 578  *==============================================================================
 579   CABO(z)         Current account balance of region z
 580   CTHO(z)         Consumption budget of households in region z
 581   DEPO(z)         Amount of depreciation (capital consumption allowance) in region z
 582   GO(z)           Current government expenditures on goods and services in region z
 583   GDP_BPO(z)      Region z GDP at basic prices
 584   GDP_BP_WO       World GDP at basic prices
 585   GDP_FDO(z)      Region z GDP at purchasers prices from the perspective of final demand
 586   GDP_IBO(z)      Region z GDP at market prices (income-based)
 587   GDP_MPO(z)      Region z GDP at market prices
 588   ITO(z)          Total investment expenditures in region z
 589   RKDO(k,j,z)     Type k capital income in industry j in region z
 590   SGO(z)          Government savings in region z
 591   SHO(z)          Household savings in region z
 592   SROWO(z)        Rest-of-the-world savings with respect to region z
 593   TDHO(z)         Household income taxes in region z
 594   TICO(i,z)       Government revenue from indirect taxes on commodity i in region z
 595   TICTO(z)        Total government receipts of indirect taxes on commodities in region z
 596   TIKO(k,j,z)     Government revenue from taxes on type k capital used by industry j in region z
 597   TIKTO(z)        Total government revenue from from taxes on capital in region z
 598   TIMO(i,zj,z)    Government revenue from duties on commodity i imported from region zj by region z
 599   TIMTO(z)        Total government revenue from import duties in region z
 600   TIPO(j,z)       Government revenue from taxes on industry j production in region z (excluding taxes directly related to the use of capital and labor)
 601   TIPTO(z)        Total government revenue from production taxes in region z (excluding taxes directly related to the use of capital and labor)
 602   TIWO(l,j,z)     Government revenue from payroll taxes on type l labor in industry j of region z
 603   TIWTO(z)        Total government revenue from payroll taxes in region z
 604   TIXO(i,z,zj)    Government revenue from export taxes on commodity i exported by region z to region zj
 605   TIXTO(z)        Total government revenue from export taxes in region z
 606   TPRCTSO(z)      Total government revenue from taxes on products and imports in region z
 607   TPRODNO(z)      Total government revenue from other taxes on production in region z
 608   YDHO(z)         Household disposable income in region z
 609   YGO(z)          Total government income in region z
 610   YHO(z)          Household total income in region z
 611   YHKO(z)         Household capital income in region z
 612   YHLO(z)         Household labor income in region z
 613   YROWO(z)        Rest-of-the-world total income from region z
