 661  *   3.1.1 Reading data aggregated with DATA_AGG-2007.gms
 662  *==============================================================================
 663  *  The PEP w-1 model uses aggregated data from GTAP8.1. The following file
 664  *  includes data for some variables and substitution elasticities.
GDXIN   C:\Users\kimc0\GUIDE_GLOBAL_CGE\CBAM\Input_w-1\DATA_AGG_250804.gdx
