2316  **CO2ICO= tCO2/$
2317  ************************************
2318  Parameter
2319   
2320   CO2IO(product,j,z) ktCO2 emission for industry j sector
2321   CO2HO(product,z)   ktCO2 direct emission for residendital sector
2322   TCO2IO(j,z)        ktCO2 total emission for industry sector j in region z
2323   CO2ICO(i,zj)       carbon content for commodity i in region z (tCO2 per$)
2324  * TCO2ICO(j,zj)      carbon content for industry sector j in region z (ktCO2 per 10 billion$ = tco2/million$ after scaling down with 1e-7)
2325   TCO2IO2(i,zj)
2326   XSTO2(i,zj)
2327   CP0(z)              CBAM carbon price per ton CO2 ($ per tCO2)
2328   
2329   
2330  * CH4IO(product,j,z) tCO2eq direct emission for industry j sector
2331  * CH4HO(product,z)   tCO2eq direct emission for residendital sector
2332   
2333  * N2OIO(product,j,z) tCO2eq direct emission for industry j sector
2334  * N2OHO(product,z)   tCO2eq direct emission for residendital sector
2335   GWP(type)          GWP 100 AR5
