2381  * N2OHO(p_gas,z)$Gas_CO(p_gas,z) = Gas_CO(p_gas,z)*41.868*GHGsEF(p_gas,'N2OEF')*1000*0.000001*GWP('N2OEF') ;
2382  * N2OHO(p_oilproduct,z)$Oilp_CO(p_oilproduct,z) = Oilp_CO(p_oilproduct,z)*41.868*GHGsEF(p_oilproduct,'N2OEF')*1000*0.000001*GWP('N2OEF') ;
